# Deno Edge Function QA

## Running Tests
- Navigate to the function directory
- Run: `deno test`

## Type Checking
- Deno has built-in TypeScript support
- Run: `deno check <file.ts>`

## Manual Testing
- Start Supabase: `npx supabase start`
- Serve functions: `npx supabase functions serve --no-verify-jwt`
- Test with curl:
  - `curl http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/get-incoming-apple -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}'`
  - `curl http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/get-incoming-orange -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}'`
